  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ReadyPlayerMeOASIS v2.0.3\n\nReady Player Me Cross-Platform Avatar SDK Provider Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- docs: add README.md for 57 providers + bump submodule pointers (87b2b85)\n- feat: add 14 new providers + AI category — 220 total (bd40ae6)\n- feat: fully implement Identity and Maps providers with real APIs (07d1e7e)\n- feat: implement real API/SDK for all new providers (21 providers across 6 categories) (0d09c71)\n- fix: resolve all build errors for new providers (stubs, usings, enum values) (a33a25e)\n- Repair provider contracts and deployed dependency pins (1c3a9ec)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Maps/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ReadyPlayerMeOASIS",
